    <svg id="mapa1" width="1200" height="960" viewBox="0 0 1200 960" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <rect width="1200" height="960" fill="#ffffff"/>
      <rect x="12" y="12" width="1176" height="936" fill="none" stroke="#0d2346" stroke-width="16"/>

      <!-- Título -->
      <rect x="330" y="38" width="540" height="64" rx="8" fill="#0d2346" stroke="#ffd600" stroke-width="5"/>
      <text x="600" y="80" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="28" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffd600" text-anchor="middle">POTENCIAÇÃO E RADICIAÇÃO</text>

      <!-- Conectores -->
      <path d="M 600 102 L 600 135 M 310 135 L 890 135 M 310 135 L 310 165 M 890 135 L 890 165" stroke="#0d2346" stroke-width="4" fill="none"/>

      <!-- Cartões de coluna -->
      <rect x="140" y="165" width="340" height="46" rx="6" fill="#00acc1"/>
      <text x="310" y="196" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">
        POTENCIAÇÃO (a<tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">n</tspan><tspan dy="8"> = b)</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="720" y="165" width="340" height="46" rx="6" fill="#d81b60"/>
      <text x="890" y="196" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">
        RADICIAÇÃO (<tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">n</tspan><tspan dy="8">√a = b)</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- ===== COLUNA ESQUERDA: POTENCIAÇÃO ===== -->
      <rect x="50" y="235" width="520" height="280" rx="8" fill="#f8fdff" stroke="#00acc1" stroke-width="3"/>
      <text x="70" y="265" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#0d2346">1. Definições e Regra de Sinais</text>

      <text x="70" y="295" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">
        • Expoente Zero:  a<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">0</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = 1   (a ≠ 0)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="70" y="323" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">
        • Expoente Negativo:  a<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">−n</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = 1 / a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">   e   (a/b)</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">−n</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = (b/a)</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="92" y="343" class="nota" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Condições: a ≠ 0 e b ≠ 0 (não existe divisão por zero)</text>

      <text x="70" y="373" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">• Base negativa e expoente INTEIRO n:</text>
      <text x="92" y="399" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" fill="#c62828">
        (−a)<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6"> é POSITIVO se n for PAR   |   NEGATIVO se n for ÍMPAR</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="70" y="435" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" fill="#d81b60">
        • Parênteses:  (−2)<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">4</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = +16   ≠   −2</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">4</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = −16</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="70" y="471" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">• Expoente fracionário m/n (a &gt; 0):</text>
      <text x="92" y="499" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="bold" fill="#6a1b9a">
        a<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m/n</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m</tspan><tspan dy="6">)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="200" y="499" class="nota" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Base negativa exige denominador n ÍMPAR.</text>

      <rect x="50" y="535" width="520" height="215" rx="8" fill="#f8fdff" stroke="#00acc1" stroke-width="3"/>
      <text x="70" y="565" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#0d2346">2. Propriedades das Potências (mesma base)</text>

      <text x="70" y="597" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">• Produto: conserva a base e SOMA os expoentes</text>
      <text x="90" y="625" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="bold" fill="#6a1b9a">
        a<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m</tspan><tspan dy="6"> · a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m + n</tspan><tspan dy="6">     [Ex: 2</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">3</tspan><tspan dy="6"> · 2</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">4</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = 2</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">7</tspan><tspan dy="6">]</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="70" y="663" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">• Divisão: conserva a base e SUBTRAI os expoentes (a ≠ 0)</text>
      <text x="90" y="691" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="bold" fill="#6a1b9a">
        a<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m</tspan><tspan dy="6"> / a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m − n</tspan><tspan dy="6">     [Ex: 5</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">8</tspan><tspan dy="6"> / 5</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">3</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = 5</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">5</tspan><tspan dy="6">]</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="70" y="729" class="nota" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Não vale para a soma: (a + b)<tspan dy="-5" font-size="10">n</tspan><tspan dy="5"> ≠ a</tspan><tspan dy="-5" font-size="10">n</tspan><tspan dy="5"> + b</tspan><tspan dy="-5" font-size="10">n</tspan></text>

      <!-- ===== COLUNA DIREITA: RADICIAÇÃO ===== -->
      <rect x="630" y="235" width="520" height="245" rx="8" fill="#fff8fa" stroke="#d81b60" stroke-width="3"/>
      <text x="650" y="265" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#0d2346">1. Propriedades dos Radicais</text>

      <text x="650" y="295" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">
        • Definição:  <tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√a = b ⇔ b</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6"> = a (n ≥ 2 inteiro)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="672" y="318" class="nota" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">n PAR exige a ≥ 0 e dá b ≥ 0; n ÍMPAR aceita a &lt; 0 e b &lt; 0.</text>

      <text x="650" y="347" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">
        • Produto / Divisão:  <tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√a·</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√b = </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(a·b)   |   </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√a / </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√b = </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(a/b)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="672" y="370" class="nota" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Válido com a ≥ 0, b &gt; 0 (b ≠ 0 na divisão).</text>

      <text x="650" y="399" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">
        • Raiz de Raiz:  <tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√a) = </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m·n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√a   [Ex: </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">3</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">2</tspan><tspan dy="6">√64) = </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">6</tspan><tspan dy="6">√64 = 2]</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="650" y="429" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" fill="#00838f">
        • Simplificação:  <tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">2</tspan><tspan dy="6">√50 = </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">2</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(25 · 2) = 5</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">2</tspan><tspan dy="6">√2</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="650" y="463" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" fill="#0d2346">
        • Conversão:  <tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m</tspan><tspan dy="6">) = a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m/n</tspan><tspan dy="6">  (a &gt; 0)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="630" y="495" width="520" height="215" rx="8" fill="#fff8fa" stroke="#d81b60" stroke-width="3"/>
      <text x="650" y="525" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#0d2346">2. Racionalização de Denominadores</text>

      <text x="650" y="553" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">• Caso 1 (raiz quadrada): multiplica por √a em cima e embaixo</text>
      <text x="670" y="579" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="bold" fill="#d81b60">6 / √3 = (6 · √3) / 3 = 2√3</text>

      <text x="650" y="609" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">
        • Caso 2 (índice n, radicando a<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">m</tspan><tspan dy="6">): multiplica por </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(a</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">n−m</tspan><tspan dy="6">)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="670" y="635" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="bold" fill="#d81b60">
        2 / <tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">5</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(3</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">2</tspan><tspan dy="6">)   →   multiplica por </tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">5</tspan><tspan dy="6">√(3</tspan><tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">3</tspan><tspan dy="6">)   [2 + 3 = 5]</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="650" y="667" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#222">• Caso 3 (soma/subtração): multiplica pelo conjugado</text>
      <text x="670" y="693" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="bold" fill="#d81b60">4 / (√5 − 1) = 4·(√5 + 1) / (5 − 1) = √5 + 1</text>

      <!-- ===== PONTE: EXPOENTE FRACIONÁRIO ===== -->
      <rect x="200" y="780" width="800" height="135" rx="10" fill="#fff9c4" stroke="#0d2346" stroke-width="4"/>
      <text x="600" y="815" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="bold" fill="#0d2346" text-anchor="middle">🔗 A PONTE: EXPOENTE FRACIONÁRIO</text>
      <text x="600" y="855" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="bold" fill="#6a1b9a" text-anchor="middle">
        a<tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">m/n</tspan><tspan dy="8"> = </tspan><tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">n</tspan><tspan dy="8">√(a</tspan><tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">m</tspan><tspan dy="8">) = (</tspan><tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">n</tspan><tspan dy="8">√a)</tspan><tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">m</tspan><tspan dy="8">    |    Ex:  27</tspan><tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">2/3</tspan><tspan dy="8"> = (</tspan><tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">3</tspan><tspan dy="8">√27)</tspan><tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">2</tspan><tspan dy="8"> = 3</tspan><tspan dy="-8" font-size="15">2</tspan><tspan dy="8"> = 9</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="600" y="890" class="nota" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle">"Quem está no sol (numerador m) vai para a sombra; quem está na sombra (denominador n) vai para o sol."</text>

